    "title": "Cannon Beach Library to host 13 authors - NewsBreak",
    "text": "discoverourcoast.com\nwebsite\nCannon Beach\nCannon Beach Library to host 13 authors\nBy Patrick Webb,\n6 hours agoCANNON BEACH — Cannon Beach Library, at 131 N Hemlock, in Cannon Beach, plans a local authors gathering. The event is 3 p.m. to 5 p.m. Sept. 27. Jen Dixon, library manager, said the event will be an opportunity to connect with local published authors, get signed books and discover new genres.",
